WEBVTT

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:13.471
[theme music plays]

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:45.438
-[frogs croaking]
-[birds chirping]

00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:56.074
-[sword slicing]
-[body thudding]

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:01.288
-[slicing continues]
-[thudding continues]

00:02:06.376 --> 00:02:08.461
-[slicing continues]
-[thudding continues]

00:02:12.841 --> 00:02:14.134
-[slicing continues]
-[thudding continues]

00:02:19.181 --> 00:02:20.933
-[slicing continues]
-[thudding continues]

00:02:25.896 --> 00:02:27.147
[sword slicing]

00:02:31.318 --> 00:02:33.070
In kung fu, we say...

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.863
"One hand lies...

00:02:34.947 --> 00:02:36.364
[both grunting]

00:02:38.116 --> 00:02:39.868
[groans]

00:02:39.952 --> 00:02:42.746
...the other hand tells the truth."

00:02:44.289 --> 00:02:45.999
[Marco] Try that again.

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:49.712
If you, one day,
make it back to the West...

00:02:50.713 --> 00:02:54.632
what will you tell men
of this strange word, "kung fu"?

00:02:54.717 --> 00:02:58.053
Will you tell them that it means to fight?

00:02:58.136 --> 00:02:59.179
Or will you say...

00:02:59.262 --> 00:03:00.889
like a monk from Shaolin...

00:03:00.973 --> 00:03:03.141
[inhales sharply]
to summon the spirit...

00:03:04.142 --> 00:03:06.186
of the crane and the tiger?

00:03:08.814 --> 00:03:10.565
[groans]

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:13.610
[panting]

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:14.737
Kung fu.

00:03:17.948 --> 00:03:21.994
It means, "supreme skill from hard work."

00:03:23.954 --> 00:03:26.915
[Hundred Eyes]
<i>A great poet has reached kung fu.</i>

00:03:29.167 --> 00:03:32.212
<i>The painter, the calligrapher...</i>

00:03:32.295 --> 00:03:35.298
<i>they can be said to have kung fu.</i>

00:03:38.719 --> 00:03:42.890
<i>Even the cook,</i>
<i>the one who sweeps steps...</i>

00:03:42.973 --> 00:03:45.058
<i>or a masterful servant...</i>

00:03:45.142 --> 00:03:48.145
<i>can have kung fu.</i>

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:52.524
<i>Practice. Preparation...</i>

00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:55.819
<i>endless repetition.</i>

00:03:55.903 --> 00:03:59.782
<i>Until your mind is weary,</i>
<i>and your bones ache.</i>

00:03:59.865 --> 00:04:02.910
<i>Until you're too tired to sweat...</i>

00:04:02.993 --> 00:04:05.287
<i>too wasted to breathe.</i>

00:04:10.167 --> 00:04:11.459
[groans]

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.339
That is the way, the only way...

00:04:16.423 --> 00:04:18.675
one acquires kung fu.

00:04:20.052 --> 00:04:21.053
[grunting]

00:04:25.849 --> 00:04:28.226
Unfortunately, boy...

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:29.686
you have not.

00:05:09.059 --> 00:05:11.812
A more fearsome army, I have never seen!

00:05:11.895 --> 00:05:14.314
It is no wonder the barbarians fled.

00:05:14.397 --> 00:05:16.233
[soldiers yelling in Mandarin]

00:05:18.568 --> 00:05:19.569
[speaking English]
Yet...

00:05:20.778 --> 00:05:23.365
it has come to the attention
of your Chancellor...

00:05:23.448 --> 00:05:27.369
that some of his soldiers have questioned
the political order of the Song court...

00:05:27.452 --> 00:05:31.915
now that the Emperor
has passed beyond our world.

00:05:31.999 --> 00:05:34.376
General.

00:05:34.459 --> 00:05:37.087
Who is the most supreme fighter
within your ranks?

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.546
Yang Chun.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:42.675
In Shantung Province, he is known as...

00:05:42.759 --> 00:05:44.302
"Whirlwind Tiger."

00:05:45.303 --> 00:05:48.681
He has mastered the
Five Animal Styles of Shaolin.

00:05:48.765 --> 00:05:52.310
May Song dynasty endure 10,000 years!

00:05:58.233 --> 00:06:02.570
What do the men say about your
Cricket Minister's praying mantis games?

00:06:04.864 --> 00:06:07.742
With humility and respect...

00:06:07.825 --> 00:06:11.413
some have spoken of
the Chancellor's insect games as a...

00:06:13.123 --> 00:06:14.749
curious hobby.

00:06:16.459 --> 00:06:19.879
Those were the only words whispered,
My Chancellor.

00:06:23.591 --> 00:06:24.759
Demonstrate...

00:06:25.718 --> 00:06:28.721
why the name Whirlwind Tiger is so famous.

00:06:30.057 --> 00:06:33.310
Defeat me,
and you are promoted to a command post

00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:36.021
with all its residual income
and pleasures.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.399
However... should I defeat you...

00:06:40.358 --> 00:06:42.277
you are my chamber boy.

00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:57.417
[yelling]

00:07:24.819 --> 00:07:25.903
-[bones cracking]
-[screaming]

00:07:35.872 --> 00:07:37.790
Praying Mantis Kung Fu.

00:07:38.875 --> 00:07:41.044
Curious little hobby?

00:07:41.128 --> 00:07:42.295
[neck snapping]

00:08:09.864 --> 00:08:12.200
Ariq was my brother.

00:08:12.284 --> 00:08:14.411
But he was a traitor.

00:08:14.494 --> 00:08:16.079
Now, he is dead.

00:08:17.414 --> 00:08:21.084
I took his head,
soaked the earth with his blood...

00:08:23.586 --> 00:08:28.216
I loved him as a brother,
but I killed him as a traitor.

00:08:29.384 --> 00:08:33.263
In my heart and by our laws...

00:08:33.346 --> 00:08:36.974
I know this to be necessary and just.

00:08:37.059 --> 00:08:40.728
Those who disagree with my actions,
speak now without repercussion.

00:08:54.242 --> 00:08:58.038
That is the last
we shall speak of my brother.

00:08:58.121 --> 00:09:01.291
Cousin Kaidu will inherit his lands,

00:09:01.374 --> 00:09:03.751
his armies, his people.

00:09:05.295 --> 00:09:06.421
Now...

00:09:06.504 --> 00:09:09.591
as to the war deferred
with the Song rebels...

00:09:09.674 --> 00:09:12.302
We were dishonored
at the Battle of Wuchang.

00:09:13.303 --> 00:09:15.680
We must visit hell
upon the Cricket Minister.

00:09:15.763 --> 00:09:18.516
With respect to my cousin, Jingim...

00:09:19.517 --> 00:09:22.354
the Khan must now assert his dominion.

00:09:24.606 --> 00:09:26.233
Our forces?

00:09:26.316 --> 00:09:29.777
With Karakorum's men
finally standing ready...

00:09:29.861 --> 00:09:32.155
-you are two armies strong.
-Three.

00:09:33.156 --> 00:09:36.451
The armies of the West
are prepared for battle, Great Khan.

00:09:36.534 --> 00:09:38.495
We await your command.

00:09:47.003 --> 00:09:48.671
I have much to think on.

00:09:52.049 --> 00:09:53.260
[Kaidu] Great Khan...

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:58.181
Tomorrow evening,
at my encampment, if I may...

00:09:59.307 --> 00:10:01.058
I invite you to a feast...

00:10:01.143 --> 00:10:03.060
in your honor.

00:10:03.145 --> 00:10:04.437
[chuckling]

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:06.648
I will attend, Kaidu.

00:10:06.731 --> 00:10:08.358
Thank you.

00:10:08.441 --> 00:10:09.942
[door opening]

00:10:18.868 --> 00:10:21.538
A tribute from the Song Chancellor,
Great Khan.

00:10:44.186 --> 00:10:45.228
[flies buzzing]

00:10:45.312 --> 00:10:48.898
How many Song prisoners
did we take at Wuchang?

00:10:48.981 --> 00:10:51.234
[Jingim] A mere dozen, Father.

00:11:11.754 --> 00:11:13.590
[court murmuring]

00:11:16.634 --> 00:11:21.306
Rip their bodies asunder, Sire.
Send Sidao their parts.

00:11:21.389 --> 00:11:25.727
[Kublai] My Minister of Finance,
identify these brave warriors.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.771
See their families receive
tribute from the treasury.

00:11:28.855 --> 00:11:31.566
That is your place.

00:11:31.649 --> 00:11:33.860
It will be done, Sire.

00:11:42.535 --> 00:11:44.120
[goats bleating]

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:15.902
[Nima] To service the Khan
is not merely an honor...

00:12:15.985 --> 00:12:17.487
it is a blessing.

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:21.783
To be sure, those who satisfy the
Lord Khan's carnal needs here on Earth...

00:12:21.866 --> 00:12:25.161
will be granted supreme favor
in the next life.

00:12:25.244 --> 00:12:28.290
As well as 20 karats of gold.

00:12:28.373 --> 00:12:31.042
You will be tested
by the royal concubines.

00:12:31.125 --> 00:12:34.296
The most proficient in the art of arousal
will earn the privilege

00:12:34.379 --> 00:12:36.756
of residing permanently here...

00:12:36.839 --> 00:12:40.302
in our Great Khan's
Hall of Five Desires.

00:12:40.385 --> 00:12:44.389
By "permanently,"
I mean just that.

00:12:44.472 --> 00:12:47.266
If selected, you will remain
in the Hall of Five Desires

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:49.268
until released from royal service.

00:12:50.395 --> 00:12:53.189
If you are chosen
to become a Royal Concubine...

00:12:53.272 --> 00:12:55.358
all needs will be met.

00:12:55.442 --> 00:12:58.320
Those not chosen will be delivered
to the Ministry of Finance

00:12:58.403 --> 00:13:00.905
to be sold off to the Khan's court.

00:13:02.073 --> 00:13:06.494
Those unclaimed by the court will be
sold to whorehouses in outer Cambulac.

00:13:10.289 --> 00:13:13.167
Perform as though
your life depends upon it.

00:13:14.126 --> 00:13:15.837
It most likely does.

00:16:40.667 --> 00:16:42.669
[boisterous chatter]

00:17:09.737 --> 00:17:11.072
Horseman. Sit.

00:17:11.155 --> 00:17:12.532
I'm in a hurry.

00:17:12.615 --> 00:17:13.783
I said sit.

00:17:13.866 --> 00:17:16.327
Business done quickly
is business done badly.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:19.664
Do you want me to do bad business, hmm?

00:17:24.961 --> 00:17:26.588
There.

00:17:26.671 --> 00:17:28.923
Eyeball to eyeball.

00:17:29.924 --> 00:17:33.427
Now, we can either deal...

00:17:35.012 --> 00:17:36.013
or fuck.

00:17:38.349 --> 00:17:40.517
Your choice.

00:17:49.736 --> 00:17:51.195
Your loss.

00:18:00.537 --> 00:18:01.623
It's opal and silver.

00:18:01.706 --> 00:18:02.707
And?

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:04.626
Last time, you gave me twice that.

00:18:04.709 --> 00:18:06.043
I had bad month.

00:18:11.382 --> 00:18:12.842
Hold, Europa.

00:18:13.926 --> 00:18:16.303
What's your business here?

00:18:17.513 --> 00:18:20.349
I'm a customer with coin.
Let me pass.

00:18:26.648 --> 00:18:27.649
[Altan] Hey.

00:18:27.732 --> 00:18:30.442
Where is the man
who owns the bay gelding outside?

00:18:30.526 --> 00:18:32.779
Go ask the horse, Latin.

00:18:34.196 --> 00:18:35.572
[Marco grunting]

00:19:11.818 --> 00:19:14.070
The grassland was
sweet and cool tonight, Za Bing.

00:19:15.071 --> 00:19:16.322
So much like my old home.

00:19:16.405 --> 00:19:18.199
And so much like his.

00:19:18.282 --> 00:19:20.868
What treasure
did you leave for him this night?

00:19:22.453 --> 00:19:24.496
You know better than to ask.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.791
My ignorance is not deep enough
to protect me.

00:19:26.874 --> 00:19:29.418
And I do not trust the scoundrel
to protect you.

00:19:29.501 --> 00:19:31.170
Tulga would not hurt me.

00:19:31.253 --> 00:19:33.464
As long as the jewels come.

00:19:34.631 --> 00:19:36.550
As long as he harbors hope to be with me.

00:19:36.633 --> 00:19:39.971
That tether will weaken, Kokachin.
And he will expose you.

00:19:40.054 --> 00:19:41.222
This must stop.

00:19:46.435 --> 00:19:47.979
Whom do you serve?

00:19:50.815 --> 00:19:53.400
We speak of this no more.

00:19:53.484 --> 00:19:54.777
And you have nothing to fear.

00:19:54.861 --> 00:19:57.989
That is precisely what I am bid to do.
Fear.

00:19:58.072 --> 00:20:00.324
I must protect you.

00:20:02.451 --> 00:20:05.705
And as you protect me...
I will protect you,

00:20:05.788 --> 00:20:07.957
Za Bing.

00:20:09.458 --> 00:20:12.211
You're my only friend in this world.

00:20:15.923 --> 00:20:19.551
[Ling Ling singing in Mandarin]

00:20:31.688 --> 00:20:33.065
[speaking English]
Sunflower?

00:20:35.026 --> 00:20:36.527
Where is your servant?

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.654
Attending to my breakfast.

00:20:40.156 --> 00:20:42.658
Excellent. Enjoy.

00:20:43.951 --> 00:20:46.954
[Ling Ling continues singing]

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:03.387
[wine pouring]

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:06.348
[sighing]
Why would he summon me?

00:21:07.308 --> 00:21:08.684
My suspicion?

00:21:08.768 --> 00:21:09.811
Yes?

00:21:09.894 --> 00:21:12.688
Is that you will discover
the answer to your question...

00:21:12.772 --> 00:21:14.065
rather soon.

00:21:14.148 --> 00:21:17.568
Perhaps you might lend your
venerable insight to another query.

00:21:17.651 --> 00:21:20.112
I would rather enjoy my wine.

00:21:20.196 --> 00:21:23.365
The Bayaut tribe. Who are they?

00:21:23.449 --> 00:21:28.245
I grasp the spirit of your question.
Tread carefully, Master Polo.

00:21:28.329 --> 00:21:31.748
Her parents, siblings, countrymen...

00:21:31.833 --> 00:21:35.377
they were slaughtered
for refusing to bend to the Khan's will.

00:21:35.461 --> 00:21:38.380
The Blue Princess is the last of her clan.

00:21:38.464 --> 00:21:40.382
How did she survive?

00:21:40.466 --> 00:21:43.010
Her royal blood is valued.

00:21:43.094 --> 00:21:46.347
She is destined to be sold
for political currency.

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:49.641
Steer your eyes from her visage.

00:21:49.725 --> 00:21:51.393
She is beyond your reach.

00:21:52.394 --> 00:21:54.313
So I've been told.

00:22:09.786 --> 00:22:11.163
You called for me, Sire?

00:22:12.915 --> 00:22:15.042
[Kublai] Do you have brothers?

00:22:16.335 --> 00:22:18.087
I wish I had.

00:22:18.170 --> 00:22:19.588
Someone to play with.

00:22:21.298 --> 00:22:23.885
Someone to conspire with.

00:22:25.219 --> 00:22:26.428
Brothers...

00:22:27.972 --> 00:22:30.557
Sometime blessing, sometime curse.

00:22:33.727 --> 00:22:35.938
Like those in your holy book.

00:22:36.022 --> 00:22:38.107
Cain and Abel?

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:40.234
Tell me of them.

00:22:41.277 --> 00:22:43.404
Sons of Adam.

00:22:43.487 --> 00:22:45.447
Cain was the first man to be born.

00:22:46.448 --> 00:22:48.575
Abel, the first to die.

00:22:48.659 --> 00:22:51.287
By the blade of his brother, yes?

00:22:52.329 --> 00:22:54.248
Envious of God's love for Abel,

00:22:54.331 --> 00:22:57.709
Cain killed his brother,
concealed his body...

00:22:57.793 --> 00:22:59.836
and lied to the Lord above.

00:23:00.963 --> 00:23:02.548
What became of the murderer?

00:23:04.258 --> 00:23:06.885
He bore the mark of Cain...

00:23:06.969 --> 00:23:10.472
and was cursed to roam the Earth.

00:23:10.556 --> 00:23:11.890
Endlessly.

00:23:13.309 --> 00:23:14.601
To this day?

00:23:15.727 --> 00:23:20.607
No. He wandered until
he could wander no more.

00:23:20.691 --> 00:23:22.693
So, he took a wife, built a house...

00:23:22.776 --> 00:23:26.447
and lived there until it collapsed
and crushed him dead.

00:23:30.326 --> 00:23:33.329
Some say this is an invented story,
nothing more.

00:23:33.412 --> 00:23:35.789
Meant to impart a greater lesson.

00:23:35.872 --> 00:23:37.749
Which is?

00:23:37.833 --> 00:23:40.419
The scholars and historians
of Venice are superior

00:23:40.502 --> 00:23:42.754
to all others across the land.

00:23:42.838 --> 00:23:45.841
I have not the studies
to begin to explore such questions.

00:23:45.924 --> 00:23:47.801
Try.

00:23:51.888 --> 00:23:54.933
It is in our nature to seek
our brother's possessions.

00:23:56.268 --> 00:23:59.438
And be willing to destroy to obtain them.

00:24:10.949 --> 00:24:13.660
Superior to all others, hmm?

00:24:15.121 --> 00:24:16.497
I did not mean to offend--

00:24:16.580 --> 00:24:20.584
You shall attend
my cousin Kaidu's feast tonight.

00:24:20.667 --> 00:24:23.295
I await your thoughts on a lesser culture.

00:24:28.425 --> 00:24:29.926
Six of them?

00:24:30.011 --> 00:24:31.845
[Ahmad] The youngest was 16.

00:24:31.928 --> 00:24:33.472
Maidar's boy. Taban.

00:24:33.555 --> 00:24:36.308
Taban. [sighs]

00:24:36.392 --> 00:24:38.769
How many times had I told Maidar...

00:24:38.852 --> 00:24:40.687
he was not prepared for war.

00:24:40.771 --> 00:24:44.233
Like you, as a boy,
his head was always in numbers.

00:24:44.316 --> 00:24:46.527
-And now it's in a thatched trunk.
-[woman moaning]

00:24:46.610 --> 00:24:48.695
[scoffs] Ahmad. Please.

00:24:48.779 --> 00:24:50.697
-My apologies, Empress.
-[sighs]

00:24:50.781 --> 00:24:52.074
[moaning continues]

00:24:52.158 --> 00:24:54.118
Send Maidar a purse of silver.

00:24:55.077 --> 00:24:56.953
It is done.

00:24:57.038 --> 00:24:58.955
The Khan commanded gold.

00:25:00.332 --> 00:25:01.917
[moaning intensifies]

00:25:10.884 --> 00:25:12.178
[Ahmad] Impressive.

00:25:12.261 --> 00:25:17.516
I will not choose my husband's concubines
based upon Shria's judgment.

00:25:17.599 --> 00:25:20.519
I've seen her faint
when a puppy licked her face.

00:25:20.602 --> 00:25:21.645
[Ahmad] Well...

00:25:21.728 --> 00:25:23.480
that's no puppy.

00:25:24.440 --> 00:25:26.442
[Chabi] Have you already
taken tally, Ahmad?

00:25:28.277 --> 00:25:30.696
Perhaps you'll add that one to your harem

00:25:30.779 --> 00:25:33.365
before selling
the castoffs to the brothels?

00:25:33.449 --> 00:25:36.493
[Ahmad] Whatever turns profits
for the Khan and fills a treasury...

00:25:36.577 --> 00:25:37.869
I will oversee.

00:25:37.953 --> 00:25:39.871
As is your duty.

00:25:39.955 --> 00:25:41.290
[Ahmad]
Yes.

00:25:42.499 --> 00:25:44.042
But not why I come to you.

00:25:45.586 --> 00:25:47.296
I know it's not my place, and...

00:25:48.422 --> 00:25:50.132
I do not wish to overstep my bounds.

00:25:50.216 --> 00:25:52.384
You are as a son to the Khan and to me.

00:25:52.468 --> 00:25:53.969
You need not hold your tongue.

00:25:54.052 --> 00:25:57.806
Have you any insight
into the Khan's private thoughts?

00:25:57.889 --> 00:25:59.600
Concerning?

00:25:59.683 --> 00:26:02.478
Spilling the blood of that savage,
Jia Sidao.

00:26:02.561 --> 00:26:06.273
Hatred does not cease by hatred.

00:26:06.357 --> 00:26:07.899
But it may be stopped by a saber.

00:26:07.983 --> 00:26:10.611
Until they eventually
turn the saber back on you.

00:26:11.612 --> 00:26:13.489
Are these matters of finance, Ahmad?

00:26:13.572 --> 00:26:16.367
Finance fuels the crucible of war...

00:26:16.450 --> 00:26:18.744
and its spoils fill our treasury.

00:26:18.827 --> 00:26:19.953
They are one and the same.

00:26:20.036 --> 00:26:22.998
Why speak of this to me?
Why not Yusuf?

00:26:23.081 --> 00:26:27.336
The Khan's ear opens widest
for you, Empress.

00:26:29.755 --> 00:26:31.132
[Shria continues moaning]

00:26:58.825 --> 00:26:59.993
You are a magician.

00:27:00.076 --> 00:27:02.371
You are certain to be selected.

00:27:02.454 --> 00:27:05.832
[Nima] Report to the Hall of Purification
for cleansing.

00:27:12.088 --> 00:27:13.257
Stop.

00:27:15.176 --> 00:27:16.927
Lift up your hair.

00:27:22.474 --> 00:27:23.600
Sit.

00:27:47.666 --> 00:27:50.544
When did you meet Ling?

00:27:50.627 --> 00:27:53.630
I held her on her third day.

00:27:56.174 --> 00:27:58.969
How did you come to know my sister?

00:28:01.388 --> 00:28:03.056
You whored together.

00:28:05.892 --> 00:28:08.895
Mei Lin was my friend.

00:28:08.979 --> 00:28:10.272
Chancellor.

00:28:16.737 --> 00:28:19.865
Do you enjoy your current station in life?

00:28:19.948 --> 00:28:21.032
As concubine?

00:28:21.116 --> 00:28:24.119
Yes... Chancellor.

00:28:24.202 --> 00:28:26.247
You may speak freely.

00:28:26.330 --> 00:28:27.748
I do, Chancellor.

00:28:27.831 --> 00:28:33.044
It seems to me
that yours is the work of animals.

00:28:33.128 --> 00:28:37.048
I see no worth in it,
as it speaks to our most base instincts.

00:28:38.091 --> 00:28:40.135
But I suppose some in life must make do

00:28:40.219 --> 00:28:43.764
with the meager skills
birth has bestowed upon them.

00:28:43.847 --> 00:28:46.308
I make no judgment, of course.

00:28:49.895 --> 00:28:51.187
You are quite stunning.

00:28:53.189 --> 00:28:54.650
I never took notice.

00:28:59.530 --> 00:29:01.031
Providence is upon you.

00:29:02.491 --> 00:29:05.619
Your days will not be spent pinned
beneath stinking flesh on the floor.

00:29:06.578 --> 00:29:08.455
You are to report every morning
to my sister's chambers

00:29:08.539 --> 00:29:09.748
to care for my niece.

00:29:09.831 --> 00:29:12.793
What you do with your nights
is entirely of your choosing.

00:29:16.004 --> 00:29:17.714
You are excused.

00:29:38.485 --> 00:29:39.903
[Chabi] No.

00:29:42.781 --> 00:29:43.865
How old?

00:29:43.949 --> 00:29:45.451
Nineteen.

00:29:50.246 --> 00:29:52.291
What of this one's family?

00:29:52.374 --> 00:29:54.668
Her father works in
the salt mines beyond the Wall.

00:29:56.086 --> 00:29:57.463
And her?

00:29:59.881 --> 00:30:02.258
Father died at Wuchang, Empress.

00:30:04.345 --> 00:30:05.637
Before that?

00:30:05.721 --> 00:30:07.306
He was a potter.

00:30:24.239 --> 00:30:25.240
Not you.

00:30:28.785 --> 00:30:29.828
You.

00:30:31.830 --> 00:30:33.164
No, Empress, please, you must--

00:30:33.248 --> 00:30:34.666
"Must"?

00:30:36.877 --> 00:30:38.294
That is all for the Khan.

00:30:39.755 --> 00:30:42.424
Take them to be dressed.

00:30:48.847 --> 00:30:50.849
[Yusuf] Do you attend the feast?

00:30:50.932 --> 00:30:54.185
My head and my heart
do not yearn for airag this evening.

00:30:56.730 --> 00:30:58.649
Are you unwell, Sire?

00:31:02.903 --> 00:31:06.322
A complicated answer
to a simple question.

00:31:06.407 --> 00:31:09.410
Prince Jingim will stand proxy.
[groans]

00:31:11.703 --> 00:31:13.539
What do you make of the boy?

00:31:16.166 --> 00:31:17.167
As heir?

00:31:17.250 --> 00:31:19.335
No, not that one.
The Latin.

00:31:21.755 --> 00:31:25.091
He appears... insightful...

00:31:25.175 --> 00:31:28.470
Passionate... reckless.

00:31:30.681 --> 00:31:34.100
Time will determine
if he will be of use to the Khanate.

00:31:42.317 --> 00:31:43.527
Hmm.

00:31:45.529 --> 00:31:47.322
Good night.

00:32:20.772 --> 00:32:22.816
[horse neighing]

00:32:24.818 --> 00:32:26.027
Greetings.

00:32:26.111 --> 00:32:28.071
Welcome, cousin.

00:32:28.154 --> 00:32:31.700
We've slaughtered 20 pigs, 30 goats,
and a dozen antelope for the fire...

00:32:31.783 --> 00:32:35.370
prepared wine and nermel for days.

00:32:35.454 --> 00:32:37.080
When does the Khan's party arrive?

00:32:37.163 --> 00:32:39.082
My men are ready to commence.

00:32:40.250 --> 00:32:41.292
Pour the drink.

00:32:42.503 --> 00:32:45.547
To begin before the Khan arrives
would be a great dishonor.

00:32:49.384 --> 00:32:53.179
The Lord Khan
had other matters to attend to?

00:32:53.263 --> 00:32:58.018
Hobbled by gout...
he sends his regrets, and me in his stead.

00:33:02.188 --> 00:33:06.442
Then let us honor the General
who led our warriors at Wuchang.

00:33:17.037 --> 00:33:19.414
May I take your horse, Master Polo?

00:33:53.156 --> 00:33:54.324
[laughing]

00:34:27.190 --> 00:34:28.942
[Kublai groaning]

00:34:32.487 --> 00:34:35.406
Arrows and sabers, I can withstand.

00:34:35.490 --> 00:34:37.367
But the gout...

00:34:37.450 --> 00:34:40.579
it's a curse from the Eternal Blue Sky.

00:34:40.662 --> 00:34:41.705
[Chabi] That...

00:34:41.788 --> 00:34:45.083
-and an excess of wine.
-Yeah...

00:34:47.961 --> 00:34:50.296
So much tension, husband.

00:34:53.925 --> 00:34:56.803
Grandfather appeared to me whilst I slept.

00:34:58.388 --> 00:35:02.183
Urged me to walk the kingdom with him...

00:35:02.267 --> 00:35:04.936
and gout wouldn't let me take a step.

00:35:07.272 --> 00:35:10.066
Genghis laughed at me.

00:35:10.150 --> 00:35:12.152
He went off on his own.

00:35:12.235 --> 00:35:15.781
The Great Genghis
did not have a brother like Ariq.

00:35:15.864 --> 00:35:18.992
A Khan has no qualms or regrets.

00:35:22.162 --> 00:35:24.580
Ahmad spoke to me.

00:35:24.665 --> 00:35:26.792
He thinks war is the answer.

00:35:26.875 --> 00:35:29.711
Why does Ahmad speak to you of war?

00:35:30.921 --> 00:35:33.548
He is a trusted minister.
I am his Queen.

00:35:33.632 --> 00:35:37.343
He has much doubt
his Khan will make the true decision.

00:35:38.344 --> 00:35:41.306
He wanted to use you to sway my mind.

00:35:41.389 --> 00:35:43.892
Well, he clearly came to the wrong person.

00:35:43.975 --> 00:35:45.226
[Kublai] Hmm.

00:35:46.352 --> 00:35:49.272
I should feed his balls to feral cats.

00:35:49.355 --> 00:35:52.317
-[laughs]
-He takes liberties with his station.

00:35:52.400 --> 00:35:55.570
He defends you
and wants only the best for you.

00:35:55.654 --> 00:35:57.363
[sighs deeply]

00:35:57.447 --> 00:36:00.867
He worries what may come
in the wake of Ariq's death.

00:36:01.868 --> 00:36:04.871
You counseled me to kill my brother.

00:36:05.914 --> 00:36:08.416
I did and I did it well.

00:36:08.499 --> 00:36:12.587
Now, you must consider
all roads before you.

00:36:12.671 --> 00:36:16.341
But the journey must not linger
in the deliberation.

00:36:17.342 --> 00:36:21.637
I can only assume you have an opinion
as to which road must be taken.

00:36:22.848 --> 00:36:24.390
[groaning loudly]

00:36:32.482 --> 00:36:34.860
Choose wisdom over wrath.

00:36:36.027 --> 00:36:40.031
Heal any rifts within yourself,
your armies, your people.

00:36:41.657 --> 00:36:44.660
The Walled City will continue to stand...

00:36:44.745 --> 00:36:47.998
only to fall at a time of your choosing.

00:37:19.988 --> 00:37:22.490
[Khutulun] I have heard much of you.

00:37:25.827 --> 00:37:28.163
Marco... Polo.

00:37:30.290 --> 00:37:31.875
What does that mean?

00:37:34.585 --> 00:37:37.005
"The Great Explorer."

00:37:37.088 --> 00:37:38.506
No.

00:37:38.589 --> 00:37:40.675
I think it means...

00:37:40.759 --> 00:37:42.343
"Pale Flower."

00:37:42.427 --> 00:37:44.179
"Flower"?

00:37:44.262 --> 00:37:45.764
You look...

00:37:45.847 --> 00:37:48.016
delicate to the touch.

00:37:48.099 --> 00:37:51.227
I have killed hundreds of men in battle.

00:37:51.311 --> 00:37:55.273
I didn't say the Pale Flower
didn't have thorns.

00:37:55.356 --> 00:37:57.192
Sharper than a Mongolian's arrow.

00:37:58.944 --> 00:38:01.362
Should I be afraid?

00:38:01.446 --> 00:38:03.073
Only if you insult me.

00:38:04.825 --> 00:38:06.701
Then...

00:38:06.785 --> 00:38:08.787
I must watch my words.

00:38:11.289 --> 00:38:13.333
And the women you have conquered.

00:38:14.876 --> 00:38:17.212
Did they melt in your hands?

00:38:17.295 --> 00:38:20.215
Like snow in the desert.

00:38:25.595 --> 00:38:27.597
Take me in your hands.

00:38:42.445 --> 00:38:43.446
[laughs]

00:38:44.948 --> 00:38:46.199
Not that.

00:38:47.408 --> 00:38:49.077
Do you wrestle in Venice?

00:38:50.661 --> 00:38:52.038
Of course.

00:38:52.122 --> 00:38:54.165
Show me.

00:38:54.249 --> 00:38:56.459
-I don't want to hurt you.
-Oh. Mmm?

00:38:56.542 --> 00:38:57.627
[chuckles]

00:39:01.589 --> 00:39:03.091
[Khutulun laughs softly]

00:39:15.728 --> 00:39:16.938
[Marco grunts]

00:39:24.112 --> 00:39:25.571
[Khutulun panting]

00:39:38.334 --> 00:39:40.003
[Khutulun panting]

00:40:12.868 --> 00:40:15.288
[Hundred Eyes]
If the Gods are always watching...

00:40:15.371 --> 00:40:17.958
we might as well put on a good show.

00:40:21.044 --> 00:40:25.131
The inability to sleep
is the curse of the aged...

00:40:25.215 --> 00:40:27.050
and the guilty.

00:40:27.133 --> 00:40:29.260
And the gout-stricken.

00:40:29.344 --> 00:40:30.470
Pardon me.

00:40:30.553 --> 00:40:32.222
I foolishly assumed

00:40:32.305 --> 00:40:35.391
you were dreaming about
your brother's head rolling in the dirt...

00:40:35.475 --> 00:40:38.769
his body, a feast for vultures.

00:40:38.853 --> 00:40:41.147
[Kublai] Do they hate me?

00:40:41.231 --> 00:40:43.441
[Hundred Eyes] It is better to be
hated for what you are

00:40:43.524 --> 00:40:46.277
than to be loved for what you are not.

00:40:46.361 --> 00:40:48.821
You're a drunken fool.

00:40:48.904 --> 00:40:50.698
So, kill me.

00:40:50.781 --> 00:40:52.742
I have thought about it.

00:40:52.825 --> 00:40:55.078
But you wish to sleep.

00:40:56.371 --> 00:40:59.915
I know you want to tell me
one of those endless stories

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:03.586
from that infernal
Chinese teacher of yours.

00:41:03.669 --> 00:41:05.755
No stories tonight, Sire.

00:41:07.298 --> 00:41:09.634
No Zen riddles?

00:41:09.717 --> 00:41:12.262
I will offer a truth instead.

00:41:12.345 --> 00:41:14.639
Had you spared Ariq...

00:41:14.722 --> 00:41:17.808
you would have encouraged other traitors.

00:41:19.227 --> 00:41:21.271
His execution was just.

00:41:21.354 --> 00:41:25.566
No. But it was necessary...

00:41:25.650 --> 00:41:30.030
in that moment,
to preserve your Empire.

00:41:30.113 --> 00:41:33.408
You ease one worry,
but aggravate one greater.

00:41:33.491 --> 00:41:36.744
As life is wont to do.

00:41:45.545 --> 00:41:46.837
[Byamba] Open your mouth!
[Marco] No, no, no, no, no.

00:41:46.921 --> 00:41:48.298
-Open it!
-No, no!

00:41:48.381 --> 00:41:49.757
[chuckles] Shut it!

00:41:51.676 --> 00:41:53.344
[men laughing]

00:41:56.681 --> 00:41:57.932
[Marco coughing]

00:42:00.060 --> 00:42:01.561
[Kaidu] Tell us, Marco.

00:42:01.644 --> 00:42:02.978
Do your feasts compare to this?

00:42:04.272 --> 00:42:05.648
They are different.

00:42:05.731 --> 00:42:07.692
[Byamba]
Here, we eat the pig.

00:42:07.775 --> 00:42:09.527
In Venice, they dance with it.

00:42:09.610 --> 00:42:13.656
If the Venetian feasts were comparable,
why would our friend leave home?

00:42:14.740 --> 00:42:16.201
We wear masks.

00:42:16.284 --> 00:42:17.910
For what purpose?

00:42:17.993 --> 00:42:19.245
The mask frees us of inhibitions.

00:42:19.329 --> 00:42:20.996
[Ahmad] And the butcher
beds the merchant's daughter...

00:42:21.081 --> 00:42:22.665
while his wife beds the gardener.

00:42:22.748 --> 00:42:24.542
The mask prevents embarrassment.

00:42:24.625 --> 00:42:25.626
[Kaidu] Interesting.

00:42:25.710 --> 00:42:29.714
Perhaps, some of our generals
should wear masks in the future.

00:42:29.797 --> 00:42:31.216
To prevent embarrassment.

00:42:32.258 --> 00:42:35.178
We have the greatest generals in the world
and all of history.

00:42:35.261 --> 00:42:37.097
We would have been victorious at Wuchang

00:42:37.180 --> 00:42:39.640
had Genghis Khan
or our Lord Kublai commanded.

00:42:39.724 --> 00:42:43.186
[Byamba] I prefer a general
with aggression in his blood

00:42:43.269 --> 00:42:46.064
to one who quakes with trepidation
on his steed.

00:42:46.147 --> 00:42:47.732
I prefer a pure general.

00:42:47.815 --> 00:42:50.068
A Mongol, raised Mongol...

00:42:50.151 --> 00:42:53.571
bathed in the blood spilt by Genghis,
steeped in his ways.

00:42:53.654 --> 00:42:56.741
A warrior like you, Byamba.
Untainted.

00:42:56.824 --> 00:42:59.702
A true Mongol.
A man.

00:42:59.785 --> 00:43:01.537
[crowd exclaiming]

00:43:03.623 --> 00:43:04.665
Or woman.

00:43:06.751 --> 00:43:10.963
[crowd chanting]

00:43:15.093 --> 00:43:17.137
Has the Khan heeded our counsel?

00:43:17.220 --> 00:43:18.929
Our Khan has a will of his own.

00:43:19.013 --> 00:43:21.474
It is a will that may break
if he fails to act.

00:43:21.557 --> 00:43:25.103
We will support and reinforce his will,
whatever it might be.

00:43:25.186 --> 00:43:26.354
[Kaidu] Of course, Minister.

00:43:26.437 --> 00:43:28.273
I would never suggest otherwise.

00:43:29.815 --> 00:43:31.401
He is my Khan.

00:43:31.484 --> 00:43:32.860
[soldiers yelling]

00:43:40.743 --> 00:43:42.120
[crowd exclaiming]

00:43:43.413 --> 00:43:45.956
Khutulun has grown more fierce with age.

00:43:46.040 --> 00:43:47.375
And more beautiful.

00:43:53.881 --> 00:43:57.552
It appears my daughter
will never take a husband!

00:43:58.553 --> 00:44:00.930
-Daughter?
-She is a prized warrior...

00:44:01.013 --> 00:44:04.058
whose virginity is promised
to any man who can defeat her.

00:44:04.142 --> 00:44:06.644
Suitors abound,
offering horses by the score

00:44:06.727 --> 00:44:08.438
for an opportunity to wrestle and win her.

00:44:08.521 --> 00:44:11.274
My herds have multiplied, but...

00:44:11.357 --> 00:44:13.818
I will find Khutulun her match.

00:44:14.819 --> 00:44:16.654
You should challenge her, Byamba.

00:44:16.737 --> 00:44:18.614
You are a powerful warrior.

00:44:18.698 --> 00:44:21.492
I am not worthy, Kaidu.

00:44:21.576 --> 00:44:24.662
Imagine if Khutulun
had commanded our armies at Wuchang.

00:44:24.745 --> 00:44:27.665
A glorious victory
she would have given our Lord.

00:44:33.421 --> 00:44:36.090
We are one wrestler short, Prince.

00:44:38.050 --> 00:44:39.760
Care to test your skills?

00:44:41.053 --> 00:44:42.680
Show us the...

00:44:42.763 --> 00:44:45.391
aggression in your blood?

00:44:46.351 --> 00:44:47.393
[Marco] I would be honored...

00:44:47.477 --> 00:44:49.312
Lord Kaidu.

00:44:51.814 --> 00:44:52.857
[laughs]

00:44:52.940 --> 00:44:54.817
[crowd cheering]

00:44:58.529 --> 00:44:59.905
[crowd chanting]

00:45:24.264 --> 00:45:25.765
[both grunting]

00:45:30.353 --> 00:45:31.729
[man groaning]

00:45:40.237 --> 00:45:42.532
[crowd exclaiming]

00:45:52.375 --> 00:45:56.879
[grunting]

00:45:58.047 --> 00:46:02.593
[crowd exclaiming]

00:46:08.057 --> 00:46:10.726
[crowd chanting]

00:46:29.078 --> 00:46:30.162
Son.

00:46:30.245 --> 00:46:31.497
Am I?

00:46:33.541 --> 00:46:36.293
I doubt the Great Khan
would humiliate his one true heir.

00:46:38.295 --> 00:46:40.506
No, the Khan wouldn't
shame his one true son

00:46:40.590 --> 00:46:43.843
by leaving him to attend a feast
with a Latin and a bastard whose--

00:46:45.219 --> 00:46:46.387
[Jingim] Go on!

00:46:49.223 --> 00:46:50.808
Kill me.

00:47:17.835 --> 00:47:19.003
[sighs]

00:47:27.678 --> 00:47:30.931
When my uncle, Ögödei,
became gravely ill...

00:47:32.767 --> 00:47:35.811
the healers and shamans...

00:47:35.895 --> 00:47:39.607
thought they could appease the spirits...

00:47:39.690 --> 00:47:44.612
by sacrificing goats, boars and stags.

00:47:46.739 --> 00:47:51.452
But Ögödei's illness just grew worse.

00:47:52.703 --> 00:47:55.998
So, they tried offering women...

00:47:56.081 --> 00:47:59.251
beggars and peasants.

00:47:59.334 --> 00:48:01.921
Nothing.

00:48:02.004 --> 00:48:04.965
Then men from the court.

00:48:05.049 --> 00:48:07.552
Still, his illness increased.

00:48:10.095 --> 00:48:13.808
And soon, when he was at death's door...

00:48:13.891 --> 00:48:17.352
his most trusted shaman determined that...

00:48:17.437 --> 00:48:22.942
the only way to cure him was...
to sacrifice a member of his family.

00:48:30.866 --> 00:48:32.702
My father, Tolui...

00:48:32.785 --> 00:48:34.286
volunteered.

00:48:42.044 --> 00:48:46.757
He drank from the poisoned cup
and when he died...

00:48:46.841 --> 00:48:49.677
Ögödei rose from his bed.

00:48:59.770 --> 00:49:01.606
That, son, was a tale

00:49:01.689 --> 00:49:05.109
conjured to save Tolui's face.

00:49:07.027 --> 00:49:08.863
Losing face.

00:49:10.197 --> 00:49:12.617
Chinese concept you've been taught...

00:49:14.243 --> 00:49:15.953
and have experienced.

00:49:21.416 --> 00:49:25.004
Truth is... Father was a weak man.

00:49:25.087 --> 00:49:30.175
Screwing whores
and drinking airag till his liver burst.

00:49:31.343 --> 00:49:35.097
He never deserved to
occupy the Mongol throne.

00:49:35.180 --> 00:49:36.932
Honor...

00:49:37.016 --> 00:49:39.184
he had none.

00:49:39.268 --> 00:49:41.061
Courage...

00:49:41.145 --> 00:49:43.313
he spent it at the gaming houses.

00:49:45.274 --> 00:49:47.693
I still hear his whining in my ear.

00:49:50.404 --> 00:49:52.197
You, too, whine like a woman.

00:49:53.741 --> 00:49:55.367
A man who would be Khan

00:49:55.450 --> 00:50:00.581
must stand tall and crush those
who dare mock him.

00:50:00.665 --> 00:50:02.332
[Jingim] You don't see?

00:50:02.416 --> 00:50:05.127
If I whine like a woman...

00:50:05.210 --> 00:50:07.504
it is because you molded me that way.

00:50:09.840 --> 00:50:13.928
They mock me because I think Chinese...

00:50:14.011 --> 00:50:15.930
because I act Chinese!

00:50:16.013 --> 00:50:17.973
Because you made me Chinese--

00:50:19.391 --> 00:50:21.977
You were taught by Chinese scholars.

00:50:22.061 --> 00:50:24.605
That does not make you less Mongol.

00:50:24.689 --> 00:50:26.732
You act it...

00:50:26.816 --> 00:50:28.442
or I will kill you.

00:50:29.443 --> 00:50:30.653
[gasps]

00:50:41.246 --> 00:50:43.749
I hear he has hundreds of consorts.

00:50:43.833 --> 00:50:46.627
I hope he has thousands.

00:50:46.711 --> 00:50:50.214
Being mounted once a year
is more than enough for me.

00:50:50.297 --> 00:50:54.134
[softly] Daiyu says his cock
is like that of a horse.

00:50:54.218 --> 00:50:56.804
[Changyang]
Then feed it oats and leave me alone.

00:50:56.887 --> 00:50:58.055
[chuckles]

00:51:27.960 --> 00:51:29.336
[gasps]

00:51:35.635 --> 00:51:36.969
[Kublai] A ladle?

00:51:37.052 --> 00:51:40.597
Your cousin said it was made by
the greatest artisan in India.

00:51:40.681 --> 00:51:43.809
From the ball sack of an elephant.

00:51:44.810 --> 00:51:47.146
Perhaps it is meant to be ornamental.

00:51:48.397 --> 00:51:50.149
And?

00:51:50.232 --> 00:51:53.318
What were your thoughts
on true Mongol culture?

00:51:54.654 --> 00:51:56.697
How was the airag?

00:51:57.614 --> 00:51:58.991
It was enjoyable.

00:51:59.992 --> 00:52:02.452
Is that the only word you can conjure?

00:52:05.247 --> 00:52:07.708
Highly enjoyable.

00:52:07.792 --> 00:52:09.043
Hmm.

00:52:12.296 --> 00:52:13.380
[grunts]

00:52:22.723 --> 00:52:24.599
How did they speak of me?

00:52:26.393 --> 00:52:27.895
With respect.

00:52:28.896 --> 00:52:31.774
Befitting one of your magnitude.

00:52:31.857 --> 00:52:32.858
Hmm.

00:52:34.777 --> 00:52:35.903
And my son?

00:52:35.986 --> 00:52:39.740
Did they afford him similar esteem?

00:52:39.824 --> 00:52:43.243
He was shown the honor
due the son of the Great Khan.

00:52:51.626 --> 00:52:54.671
Describe for me what you saw, Latin...

00:52:54.755 --> 00:52:56.548
as you saw it.

00:53:04.849 --> 00:53:06.641
A lie...

00:53:08.018 --> 00:53:09.895
can cost innocent lives.

00:53:12.272 --> 00:53:15.735
A lie about how the House of Ögödei...

00:53:15.818 --> 00:53:18.988
treats the son of Kublai...

00:53:19.071 --> 00:53:21.824
endangers this entire Empire!

00:53:26.954 --> 00:53:29.832
Such lies should be punished.

00:53:33.794 --> 00:53:34.837
[Marco] No.

00:53:34.920 --> 00:53:36.671
Sire, no!

00:53:39.508 --> 00:53:40.717
[grunting]

00:53:54.398 --> 00:53:55.900
[panting]

00:54:03.908 --> 00:54:05.325
Well, if I let him walk away,

00:54:05.409 --> 00:54:08.662
he will have his wine
six nights from now and say...

00:54:08.745 --> 00:54:12.917
"Khan was lied to by a lowly foreigner
and gave that liar his leave."

00:54:15.920 --> 00:54:17.504
He shares your sin now.

00:54:19.924 --> 00:54:21.050
He is your scapegoat.

00:54:42.863 --> 00:54:46.033
Go, Latin.
Sleep off the drink.

00:55:10.224 --> 00:55:11.808
[panting]

00:55:25.447 --> 00:55:29.952
[kissing and panting]

00:57:24.149 --> 00:57:25.150
[hissing]